  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, combine water, vinegar, brown sugar, salt, black pepper, and juniper berries.",
    "2. Add the beef to the marinade and refrigerate for at least 2 days.",
    "3. Preheat oven to 300°F (150°C).",
    "4. Remove the beef from the marinade and place in a Dutch oven.",
    "5. Add the beef broth to the pot and cover.",
    "6. Place the pot in the preheated oven and cook for 3-4 hours.",
    "7. Remove the pot from the oven and let cool slightly.",
    "8. Slice the beef against the grain and serve with the juices."
